{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c5f5638d-4fb4-4bc1-8c9a-6a5a1f0ad001",
    "name": "TRALDISPORTA API - Technical Maintenance",
    "description": "# TRALDISPORTA API - Technical Maintenance\n\nColeccion preparada para publicar documentacion tecnica mediante Postman Documenter.\n\n## Objetivo\n\nEsta coleccion documenta los endpoints principales expuestos por `restapi_client_prod`, la capa publica/proxy de la API de Traldisporta.\n\n## Arquitectura\n\nCliente externo -> `restapi_client_prod` -> `restapi_prod` -> Mtrans / MySQL / Movertis / SMTP.\n\n## Autenticacion\n\nUsar el header:\n\n`Authorization: {{apiKey}}`\n\nLa variable `apiKey` debe definirse en el entorno de Postman y no debe publicarse con valor real.\n\n## Variables\n\n- `baseUrl`: URL base publica. Por defecto `https://api-traldisporta.com/api/v1`.\n- `apiKey`: API key del consumidor.\n\n## Nota operativa\n\n`getExpeditionsData` puede tardar mas de 2 minutos y devolver respuestas de mas de 1 MB. Ante errores cURL, revisar timeouts y logs de `restapi_client_prod`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "Authorization",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{apiKey}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Content-Type', value: 'application/json' });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://api-traldisporta.com/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
